# VHS Tape for CoinMarketCap Alpha Terminal Demo
Output "assets/cmc_terminal_demo.gif"
Output "assets/cmc_terminal_demo.mp4"

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set TypingSpeed 25ms

Type "make test"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "make demo"
Enter
Sleep 5s

Sleep 2s
